MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "Extra microSD storage fits my Raspberry Pi projects and file storage needs. The 256GB SanDisk card offers useful additional room, provided my device supports it.",
    "The gaming surface feels like a useful addition to my desk alongside my gaming headset and keyboard accessories. It complements equipment I already use."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The long Ethernet cable, USB Wi-Fi adapter and Wi-Fi extender relate to networking, but my recent Ethernet adapter and patch cables already address my immediate needs. I have no identified need for a long cable run or better wireless coverage.",
    "Another headset is not a priority because I already have gaming and everyday headphones. The car antenna adapter, drawing glove and VHS converter require specific projects that my history does not establish."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "Buying networking equipment seems to have been taken as interest in more networking equipment, without considering what problem each purchase solves.",
    "My interest in computer accessories seems to have been stretched to specialized electronics accessories even when they serve unrelated activities."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent purchases suggest I am filling particular setup needs. An accessory that adds a useful capability matters more to me than another item serving a need I recently addressed.",
    "The two microSD cards fit the same potential need, but I would choose the larger SanDisk this time after checking compatibility. Interest in storage does not mean I want both cards."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my computer setup and storage interests, but missed the distinction between useful additions, recently addressed needs and unrelated projects."
}
